  welcomeOpenSea: ["Polygon et Solana · découverte via OpenSea","Polygon and Solana · discovery via OpenSea","Polygon y Solana · descubrir con OpenSea","Polygon und Solana · über OpenSea entdecken","Polygon и Solana · просмотр через OpenSea","Polygon і Solana · перегляд через OpenSea","Polygon 与 Solana · 通过 OpenSea 浏览","Polygon وSolana · استكشاف عبر OpenSea"],
